{"3711160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HELLSPRINT", "steam_appid": 3711160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proudly brought to you in collaboration with the European Speedrunner Assembly (ESA)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >READY? GO.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>HELLSPRINT</strong>, a hyper-focused, first-person speedrunner with focus on pure adrenaline, frame-perfect execution, and the very pinnacle of competitive grinding. HELLSPRINT will test your mechanics, your dedication and your reflexes to the absolute limit. In order to succeed you will need to push your memory, mechanics and mastery to the very edge of the envelope. Your next obsession is here.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape purgatory. Outrun your fear. Only the fastest will live.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HELLSPRINT drops you into quickfire, dangerous trials designed to be conquered in under 30 seconds. But don't let the short clock fool you, each run will allow you to shave milliseconds off your time, bringing you ever closer to that elusive top spot. ‘One more try’ never felt so hellish.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Global &amp; Friend Leaderboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your grinding in real time against your friends and the best in the world with every attempt. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hidden Collectibles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you’re not first, you’re last, but those with a passion for exploration will be rewarded.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proudly brought to you in collaboration with the European Speedrunner Assembly (ESA)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >READY? GO.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>HELLSPRINT</strong>, a hyper-focused, first-person speedrunner with focus on pure adrenaline, frame-perfect execution, and the very pinnacle of competitive grinding. HELLSPRINT will test your mechanics, your dedication and your reflexes to the absolute limit. In order to succeed you will need to push your memory, mechanics and mastery to the very edge of the envelope. Your next obsession is here.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape purgatory. Outrun your fear. Only the fastest will live.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HELLSPRINT drops you into quickfire, dangerous trials designed to be conquered in under 30 seconds. But don't let the short clock fool you, each run will allow you to shave milliseconds off your time, bringing you ever closer to that elusive top spot. ‘One more try’ never felt so hellish.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Global &amp; Friend Leaderboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your grinding in real time against your friends and the best in the world with every attempt. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hidden Collectibles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you’re not first, you’re last, but those with a passion for exploration will be rewarded.</p>", "short_description": "A hyper-focused, first-person speedrunner with a focus on pure adrenaline, frame-perfect execution, and the very pinnacle of competitive grinding.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711160/91cb0c6638e98c7bfd691d374c93fee4be976263/header.jpg?t=1785864371", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711160/31951c070d49ffd1a8adc8d96e9ed1b6f728b87e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785864371", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711160/31951c070d49ffd1a8adc8d96e9ed1b6f728b87e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785864371", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-6300HQ<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11